<Base title="Studio — Raveenthiran" description="The studio of Nishuthan Raveenthiran — a photographic practice based in Vienna, working across Europe." active="studio">
	<div class="page">
		<div class="page-head" data-reveal>
			<h1 class="page-title">Studio</h1>
			<p class="eyebrow">Vienna · Europe</p>
		</div>

		<div class="two-col" data-reveal>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>Nishuthan Raveenthiran is a photographer based in Vienna, working across Europe on portrait, wedding and street photography. The work favours available light, restraint, and the quiet spaces between moments.</p>
				<p>Much of it begins as personal and collaborative work — TFP sessions with people who trust the process — and grows into commissions from there. The archive is organised by album; browse it under <strong>Work</strong>.</p>
				<p>For commissions and personal projects, start an enquiry — an instant estimate, with a firm quote by email within 24 hours.</p>
			</div>
			<dl class="contact-list">
				<div class="row"><span class="k">Based in</span><span>Vienna, AT</span></div>
				<div class="row"><span class="k">Working</span><span>Across Europe</span></div>
				<div class="row"><span class="k">Focus</span><span>Portrait · Wedding · Street</span></div>
				<div class="row"><span class="k">Response</span><span>Within 24 hours</span></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</div>
</Base>
